# Copy this file to .env for local development if you ever need to override anything below.
# There are no server-side secrets required to build or deploy this site: GitHub Actions
# deploys to GitHub Pages using its own built-in, automatically-provided credentials, and
# Decap CMS's DecapBridge/git-gateway backend needs no server-held tokens of ours either.

# --- Decap CMS auth backend (public/admin/config.yml) ---
# Not a secret (it's embedded in the public admin bundle) — kept here as the single source of
# truth referenced when generating config.yml for a new environment.
DECAPBRIDGE_SITE_ID=
